{"id": 2, "t": "proposal", "ts": 1790056101.5942852, "round": 0, "agent": "a0", "source": "agent", "subtype": "approach", "title": "compute-allocation co-design", "justification": "", "detail": "Treat the 5-min budget as a FLOP/bandwidth allocation problem: measure where the step time actually goes (output head vs body vs attention), then re-balance model size, batch size, head/MLP shapes and the loss computation to buy more effective tokens. I will not assume the shipped DEPTH=8 / dim=512 / 2^19-token batch is optimal, nor that the f32 softcapped logit head is free.", "degenerate": ""}
